            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/f4389bc2-ffb2-4511-9721-a0f267d02e87_rw_1920.jpeg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="The temple of " /></p>
                <p>As we arrive in the parking lot, there's dust everywhere. Although it's early august and <em>Ferragosto </em>has not yet started it feels like the whole of Italy has planned to come here today. There are cars everywhere, and -in typical Sicilian fashion-, hardly any road signage to tell you where to go, or even how to pay for the parking. </p>
